#. Translators: Spoken when F4 (next book) is pressed while already on the last book.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:887
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:8331
msgid "Already at last book"
msgstr "To już ostatni audiobook"

#. Translators: Spoken when previous part is pressed while already on the first part of a book.
#. Translators: Spoken when Shift+F3 (previous part) is pressed while already on the first part of a book.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:905
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:8362
